          objective: 'Finish the ten-hand sequence with the lowest cumulative score.',
          gameplay: 'On each turn, draw from stock or discard, optionally lay required meld contracts and lay off, then discard. Each hand has a specific contract requirement (sets/runs combinations). When a player goes out, others score cards left in hand. After ten hands, lowest total score wins.',
